  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "December 1999. A hijacked Indian plane on a Taliban runway, and three prisoners traded to bring the hostages home."
    },
    {
      "text": "The hostages walked free. So did the three men."
    },
    {
      "text": "Within weeks, one of them founded Jaish-e-Mohammed."
    },
    {
      "text": "A parliament attacked. A journalist taken. A convoy bombed. Every link runs back to the same seven days."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Butterfly Effect. Now on The Sisodia Files."
    }
  ],
